      ],
      "finding": "The rules read practice.last_activity_date (frontend/src/utils/intelligentRouting.ts:361), not bd_activities, and no code in v1.1.345 (frontend or backend/supabase) writes last_activity_date when a call or visit is saved. A database trigger predating repo history could exist; it was not inspected. Not confirmed — possible product defect (logging activity may never clear the New practice badge).",
      "proposed_text": "Suggestions are kept for about 5 minutes; reload the page to recalculate them.",
      "proposed_checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": "const CACHE_DURATION = 5 * 60 * 1000; // 5 minutes",
